# The build context of apps/server/Dockerfile and apps/web/Dockerfile is the repository root.
# What neither image needs stays out of it. The connectors stay in: the server reads two of their manifests as the
# examples of the protocol it serves (apps/server/src/routes/protocol.ts). A connector's own image builds from its
# own folder and has no use for this file.
.git
.github
.claude
.devcontainer
**/node_modules
**/dist
docs
site
tests
test-results
playwright-report
**/.env
**/.env.*
.auth-test.env
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
